
% Fragments of Time

a: ii | V | I | vi |
link: ii | V | I | vi |
a_sub: ii | V | vi | iii |
aa: $a $a_sub
In: $a $a_sub
Vr: $a $a_sub
a_cad: ii | vi | I |
Ch: $a_cad*2
link_2: $a_cad*2
bridge: $a_cad*4
ending: ii | vi | . IV | I |
Ch_final: $a_cad $ending
S: [C] $In $Vr*2 $Ch $link $Vr $Ch $bridge $link_2 $Ch_final
